# Sneat theme only

All industrial-web UI uses the Sneat (Bootstrap 5) theme. Unless the user
explicitly asks for something different:

- Style with Sneat/Bootstrap classes (`card`, `card-header`, `badge`,
  `bg-label-*`, `avatar-initial`, `text-muted`, `form-select`, ...).
- Do not introduce custom colors: no gradients, no hard-coded hex or rgba
  color values, no `text-white`/`bg-*` overrides on top of theme surfaces.
- Do not redefine Bootstrap utility classes in `globals.css`.
- Custom CSS is acceptable only for behavior the theme does not provide
  (hover affordances, transitions, layout fixes) and must reference theme
  variables such as `--ind-primary` rather than literal colors.
